  29  * 1 Set definition
  30  *==============================================================================
  31  * The sets are defined in the DATA_AGG-2007.gms file and are stored in the
  32  * DATA_AGG-2007.GDX output file. Any changes in the aggregation of industries
  33  * and/or region is thus automatically taken into account in the current file.
  34  SET
  35   J               All industries
  36   I               All commodities
  37   I1(I)           All commodities except agriculture (agr)
  38   I2(I)           Backstop technology
  39   BUS(J)          Private industries
  40   PUB(J)          Public industries
  41   F               Production factors
  42   L(F)            Labor categories
  43   K(F)            Capital categories
  44   Z               Regions
  45   ZR(Z)           Reference country (USA)
  46   Z1(Z)           All regions except reference region
  47   Zrich(Z)        Rich regions
  48   Zother(Z)       Non-rich regions
  49   
