4385  *==============================================================================
4386  *   6.1.3 Closures
4387  *==============================================================================
4388  *$ontext
4389  * FP CLOSURE: fixed PIXGDPs; numeraire is exchange rate of reference region
4390  * The exchange rates are endogenous, except for the reference region.
4391   e.FX(zr,time)      = eO(zr);
4392   PIXGDP.FX(z,time)  = PIXGDPO(z)/sum[zr,eO(zr)];
4393  *$offtext
4394   
      * FE CLOSURE: fixed exchange rates; numeraire is PIXGDP of reference region
      * The exchange rates can be fixed at arbitrary values
       PIXGDP.FX(zr,time)  = PIXGDPO(zr);
       e.FX(z,time)        = eO(z);
